<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss newspaper ad pages rise 1.0 pct in July y/y.</title>
<headline>Swiss newspaper ad pages rise 1.0 pct in July y/y.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advertising pages in Swiss newspapers rose 1.0 percent in July compared with a year earlier, according to figures compiled by the WEMF media tracking agency. (pct change in pages vs year-ago)</p>
<p>						   July     Jan-July</p>
<p> Daily/weekly newspapers		  + 1.0	- 6.0</p>
<p> Commercial ads			     - 0.1	- 4.4</p>
<p>    Employment ads			  + 9.2     - 17.1</p>
<p> Free newspapers			    + 6.6	- 2.0</p>
<p>    Commercial ads			  + 7.7	+ 0.2</p>
<p>    Employment ads			  - 6.9     - 28.4</p>
<p> Magazines				    - 3.1	- 4.2</p>
<p>    Multicolour ads			 - 2.1	- 1.2</p>
<p>    Black and white ads		   - 5.4     - 11.9</p>
<p> Specialised publications		 - 7.1	- 7.8</p>
<p>    Multicolour ads			 - 6.2	+ 3.4</p>
<p>    Black and white ads		   - 7.6     - 12.7</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
